'''Blizzard Boulevard''' (ブリザード自動車道 ''Burizādo Jidōshadō'', '''Blizzard Expressway''') is the 45th sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in the [[Version 6.8 Update]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Harder than your average sub-chapter. The first stage and the last are notably tricky to beat, the second and fifth vary in difficulty based on [[anti-Starred Alien Treasures]], while the stages in the middle are of average late Stories of Legend difficulty. The hardest stage can be considered the last stage, [[Scorched Tollbooth]], in which you are rushed by 400% [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] and a [[Hackey]] with almost no time to get money or [[Toasty Turnpike]] where a brutal combo appears with [[Cala Maria]]s and [[Brollow]]s with a tanky [[The Face]] making sure you dont push through to the base (this stage can be extremely tricky, especially in 4 crown if you dont have [[Bubble Cat]]).
{{LegendDiff|120|130|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[Hackey]]: A [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] variant of [[Tackey]] with extreme attack power as well as higher health and range, but a bigger blind spot and a longer delay between attacks.

